    "quote": "Let $\\pi$ be O3FU algorithm. Then there exists a finite constant $K_1>0$ such that for any $T \\ge 1$, $n\\ge 0$ and $\\hat p \\in [l,u]$, and for any possible value of $\\theta^* \\in \\Theta^{\\dag}$, R^{\\pi}_{\\theta^*}(T) \\le K_1 \\cdot \\Big( \\sqrt T \\wedge \\frac{T\\log T}{(n \\wedge T)\\delta^2}\\Big)\\cdot \\log T."
   },
